      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://cdn.outsideonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/death-valley.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn.outsideonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/death-valley.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn.outsideonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/death-valley.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn.outsideonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/death-valley.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn.outsideonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/death-valley.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn.outsideonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/death-valley.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<figure><img alt=\"An Ode to Our National Parks\" src=\"https://cdn.outsideonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/death-valley.jpg?width=1200\" /></figure>\n<p>Getting deep into the backcountry is great, but there is profound value in sharing iconic views with the rest of the world.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.outsideonline.com/adventure-travel/national-parks/ode-to-our-national-parks/\">An Ode to Our National Parks</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.outsideonline.com\">Outside Online</a>.</p>",
